        "Quality improvement methods include Plan-Do-Study-Act cycles, Lean (eliminating waste), and Six Sigma (reducing variation). Organizations track measures, report data publicly, and pursue accreditation. Patient safety efforts reduce errors through system redesign rather than blame.",
